WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.400
Slash review uses the implementation review
skill to look for defects in your staged change.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.044
Here, the new shout flag is still read
as the first positional argument.

3
00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:17.720
Pi runs the example to confirm the wrong
greeting and points to the line that causes it.

4
00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:34.833
You get a finding with the location,
the exact input, and what went wrong.

5
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:37.347
The staged change is left as it was.
